title: "Transit Desert Identification Pipeline (Extended)"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end Python pipeline that identifies transit deserts, Census tracts
  where demand for public transit exceeds supply, using spatial statistics,
  accessibility modeling, and ACS demographic data.
